def author(c,s,m,a):
 c('b234','堆石變形、混凝土面板與周邊接縫的相容~Compatibility of rockfill deformation, concrete facing and perimeter joints',['usbr-embankment','usbr-construction','usbr-filter','usace-gravity','usbr-dsindex'],r'''
堆石孔隙與密實~Rockfill voids and density||堆石透過顆粒重排和局部破碎變密，現場乾密度反映總孔隙但不直接給出壓縮模數。顆粒尺寸遠大於一般試體時，尺寸效應必須獨立處理。~Rockfill densifies by particle rearrangement and breakage. Dry density indicates bulk voids but does not directly give compressibility, and particles larger than normal specimens require separate treatment of scale effects.||假設顆粒密度2700 kg/m³、乾密度2100 kg/m³，孔隙率n=1−ρd/ρs=0.2222；忽略顆粒內孔隙和含水修正誤差。~Assume particle density 2700 kg/m³ and dry density 2100 kg/m³. Porosity n=1−ρd/ρs=0.2222, excluding intraparticle pores and moisture-correction error.||在代表性試填區量測鋪層前後體積與乾質量，核對大粒徑取樣方法；將密度、沉降與級配破碎變化一起比較，確認結果不是細料流失造成的假密實。~Measure trial-fill volume and dry mass before and after compaction and check large-particle sampling. Compare density, settlement and grading changes to ensure apparent densification is not an artifact of losing fines.||孔隙率相同的不同岩性可能有不同破碎和濕化壓縮，密度高也不必然代表長期變形小。若把料場小樣性質直接外推大粒徑填築，會漏掉尺度差異。~Different rock types at equal porosity can have different breakage and wetting compression. High density need not imply small long-term movement, and small quarry samples can miss full-scale particle effects.||堆石孔隙率相同就代表其壓縮模數和濕化變形完全相同。~Equal rockfill porosity means identical stiffness and wetting deformation.
分層壓縮與壩頂沉降~Layer compression and crest settlement||堆石壩沉降是不同高程層壓縮的累積，局部大應變不一定出現在壩頂。分層量測能辨認填築、蓄水與長期作用各自造成的位移。~Crest settlement accumulates compression across layers, while the largest local strain need not occur at the crest. Layered measurements distinguish placement, impoundment and long-term contributions to movement.||假設兩填築層厚30及50 m、豎向應變0.003及0.002，總壓縮30×0.003+50×0.002=0.19 m；一維分層近似。~Assume layers 30 and 50 m thick with vertical strains 0.003 and 0.002. Total compression is 0.19 m, a one-dimensional layered approximation.||比較分層沉降計與壩頂測量的閉合，將各層填築完成時間和蓄水歷程對齊；檢查儀器錨點是否移動，並區分地基沉降與壩體自身壓縮。~Close layer-settlement measurements against crest surveying and align completion dates with reservoir history. Check anchor movement and separate foundation settlement from compression within the embankment itself.||只看壩頂總沉降可能把某一薄層的大應變平均掉，面板卻對局部曲率敏感。若基礎基準也沉降，所有相對儀器可能低估絕對位移。~Crest settlement can average out severe strain in a thin layer, while the face responds to local curvature. A settling reference foundation can make relative instruments understate absolute movement throughout the section.||壩頂沉降量很小就能排除任何局部填築層的大變形。~Small crest settlement rules out large deformation in every individual fill layer.
面板曲率與拉應變~Face curvature and tensile strain||混凝土面板隨堆石支承變形彎曲，曲率比整體平移更直接影響表面拉應變。面板厚度與支承接觸條件共同控制反應，不能只檢查混凝土抗壓強度。~Concrete facing bends with its rockfill support, and curvature influences tensile strain more directly than rigid translation. Thickness and support contact govern response, so compressive strength alone is insufficient.||假設面板厚0.4 m、曲率0.001 m⁻¹，中性軸居中且線彈性，表面應變κt/2=0.0002，即200 microstrain；未含膜應變。~Assume face thickness 0.4 m, curvature 0.001 m⁻¹ and centered neutral axis under linear bending. Surface strain κt/2=200 microstrain, excluding membrane strain.||用相鄰測點曲線估算曲率，檢查測距與數值微分對雜訊的敏感性；對照面板兩面應變和裂縫方向，並將剛體位移與局部彎曲分開判讀。~Estimate curvature from neighboring survey points and test sensitivity to spacing and differentiation noise. Compare opposite-face strains and crack direction, distinguishing rigid movement from local bending in the interpretation.||支承局部脫空可能使彎曲集中，即使整體沉降平滑仍可裂縫。用過長測距平均曲率會漏掉短波變形，單側應變也難分膜力與彎曲。~Local support loss concentrates bending despite smooth overall settlement. Long gauge spacing averages away short-wavelength curvature, while one-sided strain alone cannot distinguish membrane action from flexural response.||面板抗壓強度高就能保證不會因支承曲率產生拉裂。~High face compressive strength guarantees no tensile cracking from support curvature.
周邊接縫位移分量~Perimeter-joint movement components||面板與趾板交界會發生張開、沉降和剪移，止水需對應三方向變形。單一合位移大小相同，不表示止水受力和漏水風險相同。~The face-plinth interface experiences opening, settlement and shear, requiring waterstops to accommodate three components. Equal resultant displacement does not imply equal waterstop loading or leakage risk.||假設接縫張開8 mm、沿縫剪移6 mm，平面合位移√(8²+6²)=10 mm；分量仍須保留，不能當成等效容許張開。~Assume opening 8 mm and along-joint shear 6 mm. Planar resultant is 10 mm, but components remain necessary and this is not an equivalent allowable opening.||以多方向接縫計保存分量和符號，對照庫位、溫度與堆石沉降；檢查量測軸線是否隨面板轉動，並比較接頭試驗採用的變形路徑而非單一合量。~Retain signed components from multi-axis joint meters and compare reservoir level, temperature and settlement. Check whether measuring axes rotate with the face and compare the tested deformation path rather than one resultant magnitude.||法向張開與剪向錯動對銅片或橡膠止水的影響不同，反覆循環也會累積疲勞。若只記錄合位移，可能把危險張開誤當較可容受的滑移。~Opening and shear act differently on metal or elastomeric waterstops, and cycles accumulate damage. Recording only a resultant can disguise critical opening as a more tolerable sliding movement.||只要接縫合位移相同，止水承受的變形模式就完全相同。~Equal resultant joint displacement means an identical deformation mode for the waterstop.
趾板基礎接觸~Plinth foundation contact||趾板把面板防滲系統接到基岩，接觸連續性與基礎水壓共同影響功能。它不是只靠混凝土重量阻水，岩面弱帶和接縫繞流也必須追蹤。~The plinth connects the face sealing system to bedrock, with contact continuity and foundation pressure controlling performance. Concrete weight alone does not block seepage through weak seams or bypass joints.||假設趾板接觸面積60 m²、總正力12 MN、上浮3 MN，有效平均壓力(12−3)/60=0.15 MPa；均勻接觸且不含彎矩。~Assume plinth contact area 60 m², normal force 12 MN and uplift 3 MN. Mean effective pressure is 0.15 MPa, for uniform contact without moment.||查驗岩面清理、地質素描和接觸取芯資料，將孔壓測點對應到弱帶；比較接縫位移與分區滲流，確認平均接觸假設沒有掩蓋局部脫開。~Review cleaned-rock mapping and contact cores and relate pressure points to weak seams. Compare joint movement with zoned seepage to ensure a mean-contact assumption is not concealing local separation along the plinth.||局部岩面凸起會造成接觸集中，弱帶沖蝕則可能形成繞流。若只用總重量除面積判斷完整接觸，會低估上浮和面板傳來偏心力的影響。~Rock high points concentrate contact while weak-seam erosion creates bypass flow. Dividing gross weight by area can understate uplift and eccentric actions transferred from the facing, giving a false impression of continuous contact.||趾板混凝土足夠重就能自動封閉所有岩面裂隙。~A sufficiently heavy concrete plinth automatically seals every bedrock fracture.
墊層反濾相容~Cushion-filter compatibility||面板墊層既提供平整支承，也需防止細料向粗堆石遷移。支承剛度和反濾能力是不同要求，級配必須與相鄰材料及施工離析一起檢查。~The face cushion supplies even support and prevents fines migrating into coarse rockfill. Support stiffness and filtration are separate requirements, so grading must be checked with adjacent materials and placement segregation.||假設基料d85=0.8 mm、相鄰反濾料D15=2.4 mm，比值3；只是粒徑保持篩選，不取代土類適用性與滲流試驗。~Assume base d85=0.8 mm and adjacent filter D15=2.4 mm, giving ratio three. This screens retention geometry without replacing soil-specific applicability or seepage tests.||從面板下實際鋪設材料取樣，對照料場級配及含泥量；以方向相符的滲流試驗觀察細料流失，並核對支承平整度是否因離析或沖刷而降低。~Sample placed material beneath the face and compare stockpile grading and fines. Use directionally relevant seepage tests to observe migration and check whether segregation or erosion reduces support uniformity.||墊層缺口可能同時造成漏流和面板脫空，局部細料流失未必立刻反映在總漏水量。只確認粒徑比合格，仍不能排除施工接頭或厚度不足。~A cushion gap can create leakage and support loss together, while local fines migration may not immediately change total leakage. Passing one grading ratio does not exclude construction discontinuities or insufficient layer thickness.||反濾粒徑比合格就能不再檢查墊層厚度和連續性。~A passing filter-size ratio removes the need to check cushion thickness and continuity.
斜面水壓與合力~Hydrostatic resultant on an inclined face||靜水壓垂直作用在面板表面，合力依垂直水深分布而非沿坡距離直接計算。法向力再由堆石支承和趾板系統傳遞，須保留方向。~Hydrostatic pressure acts normal to the face and varies with vertical depth rather than slope distance alone. Rockfill support and plinth transfer the normal resultant, whose direction must be retained.||取淡水單位重γw=9.81 kN/m³。假設每米寬面板斜長50 m、坡角對水平30°，底部垂深25 m，合力γw hL/2=6131.25 kN/m；平面靜水且頂部在水面。~Use freshwater unit weight γw=9.81 kN/m³. Assume face slope length 50 m per metre width at thirty degrees to horizontal, giving bottom depth 25 m. Resultant γw hL/2=6131.25 kN/m, with the top at the surface.||將面板測量剖面換成垂直水深，分別積分法向力與對趾部力矩；核對水位基準、實際淹沒範圍和支承反力方向，避免把水平投影與斜面面積混用。~Convert surveyed slope coordinates to vertical depth and integrate normal force and toe moment separately. Check datum, wetted extent and support-reaction directions, keeping horizontal projections distinct from inclined surface area.||以斜長當水深會高估壓力，忽略法向分量又會誤判支承需求。若面板部分失去接觸，水壓將引起局部彎曲，不能仍假定全部均勻傳入堆石。~Using slope length as depth overstates pressure, while ignoring direction misstates support demand. Loss of contact causes local bending under water load and invalidates uniformly transferred pressure into the rockfill.||斜面上任一點水壓應依沿坡距離而非垂直水深計算。~Pressure at an inclined-face point depends on slope distance rather than vertical depth.
分期蓄水與濕化沉降~Staged filling and wetting settlement||蓄水會讓堆石受水壓並發生濕化變形，沉降速率可能落後水位。分期觀測的目的在辨認反應，不是用固定等待天數保證所有材料已穩定。~Impoundment adds water loading and wetting deformation, with settlement potentially lagging stage. Staged observation identifies response rather than guaranteeing stabilization after a universal waiting duration.||假設教學一階沉降S(t)=S∞(1−e^(−t/τ))，S∞=0.1 m、τ=10 days，20 days達86.47 mm；僅擬合模型，非真實材料定律。~Assume teaching settlement S(t)=S∞(1−e^(−t/τ)), S∞=0.1 m and τ=10 days. At twenty days S=86.47 mm, a fitted model rather than a material law.||將水位階段、分層沉降和面板接縫同步作圖，檢查每次階段是否有不同時間常數；用後續資料驗證預測區間，不能只以早期擬合度宣稱趨勢可靠。~Plot reservoir stages, layer settlement and face joints together and check whether each stage has a different time constant. Validate prediction intervals on later data rather than relying only on an early fit.||材料破碎和應力重分配可能使長期趨勢偏離指數衰減，水位繼續變化也破壞單步載入假設。若把擬合漸近值當實際最終值，可能低估後續接縫位移。~Particle breakage and redistribution can depart from exponential decay, while changing water level violates a single-step load. Treating a fitted asymptote as a final value can understate later joint displacement.||教學沉降曲線擬合良好就能保證最終沉降不再增加。~A good fit to the teaching settlement curve guarantees no further ultimate settlement.
漏流與水量閉合~Leakage and water-balance closure||漏水量需與庫位、降雨和排水系統一起判讀，總量增減不能單獨定位面板裂縫。分區量測與水質示蹤可區分壩體、基礎和外部集水。~Leakage must be interpreted with reservoir level, rain and drainage. Total change alone cannot locate face cracks; sectional measurement and water-quality tracing distinguish embankment, foundation and external collection.||假設量測出水120 L/s、可辨識降雨集水30 L/s、儀器零偏5 L/s，校正滲流85 L/s；各來源穩定且可相加，未含儲水延遲。~Assume measured outflow 120 L/s, identified rain collection 30 L/s and instrument offset 5 L/s. Corrected seepage is 85 L/s, with steady additive sources and no storage lag.||分區校核量水設施並保存雨量和庫位時序，以溫度或電導差辨認來源；將接縫開度事件與漏流延遲對照，再檢查水量閉合殘差是否超過量測不確定度。~Calibrate sectional flow measurements and retain rain and level histories, using temperature or conductivity to distinguish sources. Compare joint events with leakage lag and test closure residuals against measurement uncertainty.||突增可能來自排水管清通而非新增裂縫，減少也可能是堵塞。未校正外部雨水便比較兩次蓄水，會把不同環境條件誤當面板性能改變。~An increase may follow drain clearing rather than a new crack, and a decrease may mean blockage. Comparing impoundments without rainfall correction confuses environmental differences with changes in face performance.||排水量減少必定表示面板防水性能改善而無其他可能。~Reduced drain discharge necessarily means improved face watertightness with no other explanation.
長期蠕變與變形預留~Long-term creep and movement allowance||堆石長期變形受到應力、含水與顆粒破碎影響，常用對數時間關係只是經驗描述。短期壓實完成不表示服役期變形停止，接縫預留需檢查情境。~Long-term rockfill deformation depends on stress, moisture and breakage. Log-time relations are empirical descriptions; completed compaction does not end service movement, so joint allowance must be checked across scenarios.||假設經驗增量ΔS=C ln(t2/t1)，C=5 mm，t1=1 year、t2=10 years，增量11.513 mm；僅穩定應力下擬合，不外推破壞。~Assume empirical increment ΔS=C ln(t2/t1), C=5 mm, t1=1 year and t2=10 years. Increment is 11.513 mm, a stable-stress fit not extrapolated to failure.||使用相同庫位與季節條件比較長期變形，核對測量基準的穩定性；將不同時間窗擬合結果及預測範圍並列，查新增沉降是否伴隨粒料破碎或孔壓變化。~Compare long-term movement at matched level and season, checking reference stability. Present fits from different time windows with prediction ranges and test whether additional settlement accompanies breakage or pore-pressure changes.||對數式在接近零時間時沒有合理施工含義，新增載重也會重設變形歷程。若用短期數據推算數十年而不檢查條件變化，會低估模型不確定度。~A logarithmic fit has no meaningful construction interpretation near zero time, and new loading changes the history. Extrapolating decades from short records without checking changed conditions understates model uncertainty.||壓實驗收完成就代表堆石壩服役期間不再發生蠕變。~Completed compaction acceptance means a rockfill dam experiences no service-life creep.
''')
 for i,ex,out,un in [(1,'1-2100/2700',.2222222,'porosity'),(2,'30*.003+50*.002',.19,'m'),(3,'.001*.4/2*1e6',200,'microstrain'),(4,'math.sqrt(8**2+6**2)',10,'mm'),(5,'(12-3)/60',.15,'MPa'),(6,'2.4/.8',3,'ratio'),(7,'9.81*25*50/2',6131.25,'kN/m'),(8,'.1*(1-math.exp(-20/10))*1000',86.46647,'mm'),(9,'120-30-5',85,'L/s'),(10,'5*math.log(10/1)',11.512925,'mm')]:a('b234',i,ex,out,un)
 c('b235','心牆阻水、反濾排水與分區填築的相容~Compatibility of core sealing, filter drainage and zoned embankment placement',['usbr-embankment','usbr-construction','usbr-filter','usbr-dsindex','usace-gravity'],r'''
分區滲透功能~Hydraulic functions of zones||心牆降低滲流，反濾層保持細土，排水層把水安全導出；三者功能不同。把所有區域都做得不透水，可能反而讓下游孔壓無法消散。~The core limits flow, filters retain fines and drains safely release water. Their functions differ, and making every zone impermeable can prevent downstream pore pressures from dissipating.||假設心牆k=10⁻⁹ m/s、平均水力坡降5、通流面積1000 m²，達西Q=kiA=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s；均質無裂縫。~Assume core k=10⁻⁹ m/s, gradient five and flow area 1000 m². Darcy Q=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s, for homogeneous uncracked material.||將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。~Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes. Compare pressure contours and discharge, using crack scenarios to identify paths omitted by the intact-soil Darcy estimate.||小範圍裂縫可能主導總流量，即使心牆材料滲透率很低。若排水層被細料污染，孔壓會增加而不是變得更安全，必須依各區功能解讀性能。~A small crack can dominate flow despite low intact-core permeability. Fines-contaminated drains can raise pressure rather than improve safety, requiring performance to be interpreted according to each zones intended function.||所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。~Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer.
含水調整與乾土質量~Moisture adjustment on dry mass||心牆含水量以水重除乾土重定義，施工加水須先區分乾土與濕土基準。含水量影響壓實、滲透和施工孔壓，不能只追求最大乾密度。~Core water content is water mass divided by dry-soil mass, so water addition requires a clear dry versus wet basis. Moisture affects compaction, permeability and construction pore pressure rather than density alone.||假設乾土1000 t、初始含水率12%、目標16%，需加水(0.16−0.12)×1000=40 t；未含蒸發和混合損失，不是工地配方。~Assume dry soil 1000 t, initial water content twelve percent and target sixteen percent. Added water is forty tonnes, excluding evaporation and mixing losses and not a field recipe.||先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。~Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity. Close added water against weather losses and compare post-compaction pore pressure, strength and permeability rather than mean moisture alone.||表面灑水可能使上濕下乾，平均含水正確仍有弱層；誤用濕土重量會算錯補水量。材料濕側施工也可能提高短期孔壓，需與穩定需求共同評估。~Surface wetting can leave wet tops and dry bottoms despite a correct mean. Using wet mass miscalculates additions, and wetter placement can raise short-term pore pressure, requiring evaluation with stability needs.||用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。~Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition.
密度孔隙與飽和度~Density void ratio and saturation||乾密度與顆粒比重決定孔隙比，再結合含水量可估飽和度。這些相態關係能抓出不合理數據，但不能取代強度與滲透試驗。~Dry density and particle specific gravity determine void ratio, which combines with water content to estimate saturation. Phase relations detect inconsistent data without replacing strength or permeability testing.||此處水密度為1000 kg/m³。假設Gs=2.7、ρd=1800 kg/m³、ρw=1000，e=Gsρw/ρd−1=0.5；含水率0.15時Sr=wGs/e=0.81。~Water density here is 1000 kg/m³. Assume Gs=2.7, dry density 1800 kg/m³ and water density 1000. Void ratio is 0.5; at water content 0.15, saturation Sr=wGs/e=0.81.||同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。~Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one. Investigate units, coarse-particle corrections and sample volume before interpreting spatial variation.||相態閉合正常仍不保證土體結構均勻，團塊間大孔隙可能與團塊內高密度共存。若比重取自不同土源，飽和度估算也會產生系統性偏差。~Consistent phase relations do not prove uniform fabric: dense clods can coexist with large interclod voids. Specific gravity from a different borrow source also creates systematic error in inferred saturation.||乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。~Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids.
水力劈裂與小主應力~Hydraulic fracture and minor stress||心牆若因拱效應使小主壓應力降低，蓄水壓力可能沿弱面推開土體。簡單總應力比較只能提示敏感性，實際起裂還取決於抗拉、缺陷和應力路徑。~Arching can reduce the core minor compressive stress, allowing reservoir pressure to open weak planes. A simple total-stress comparison indicates sensitivity; initiation also depends on tension resistance, defects and stress history.||假設局部總小主壓應力250 kPa、水壓220 kPa，差30 kPa；若拱效應降低總應力50 kPa，差變−20 kPa，僅無抗拉篩選。~Assume local total minor compression 250 kPa and water pressure 220 kPa, leaving 30 kPa. Reducing total stress by 50 kPa gives −20 kPa, a zero-tension screening comparison only.||核對量測的是總應力還是有效應力，將孔壓和土壓計布置到同層位；比較蓄水前後應力路徑，並用裂縫、漏流與反濾保護證據一起判讀敏感區。~Identify total versus effective stress and colocate pressure and earth-pressure observations by layer. Compare pre- and post-filling stress paths and interpret sensitive zones using cracks, seepage and filter protection together.||以豎向覆土壓力代替最小主應力會漏掉橫向低應力區，儀器局部剛度也可能干擾讀值。只比單一水壓數字，不能確定劈裂位置或後續內部侵蝕。~Replacing minor principal stress with vertical overburden misses low lateral-stress zones, while instrument stiffness disturbs readings. A single pressure comparison cannot locate fracture or establish subsequent internal erosion.||只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。~Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress.
心牆拱效應與沉降差~Core arching and differential settlement||較軟心牆與較硬壩殼變形不同，界面剪力可把部分豎向荷載轉移到兩側。這有時降低心牆壓應力，不能把荷載轉移一律視為有利。~A softer core and stiffer shells settle differently, allowing interface shear to transfer vertical load sideways. Reduced core compression can be unfavorable, so load transfer is not automatically beneficial.||假設原豎向應力600 kPa、側向界面轉移比例0.25，剩餘450 kPa；此為量化荷載分配假設，不是普遍拱效應係數。~Assume original vertical stress 600 kPa and side-interface transfer fraction 0.25. Remaining stress is 450 kPa, an assumed load split rather than a universal arching coefficient.||比較心牆和壩殼分層沉降、土壓與孔壓，檢查荷載是否按界面方向轉移；用不同剛度比模型測試局部低應力區，並核對施工高差的時間歷程。~Compare layer settlement, total stress and pore pressure in core and shells, checking interface load-transfer direction. Test low-stress zones across stiffness ratios and retain the history of construction elevation differences.||窄谷或陡峭岸坡容易形成複雜三維拱效應，單一二維係數可能不足。若只以心牆壓力降低當作減載好處，會忽略裂縫與水力劈裂敏感性提高。~Narrow valleys and steep abutments create three-dimensional arching beyond one two-dimensional coefficient. Viewing reduced core stress only as beneficial unloading overlooks increased sensitivity to cracking and hydraulic fracture.||心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。~Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance.
反濾保持與排水能力~Filter retention and drainage capacity||反濾材料要保持心牆細粒又提供足夠通水性，兩條要求需同時滿足。粒徑比只是初步條件，分散性土與間斷級配需要專門試驗。~Filters must retain core particles while providing adequate flow capacity, requiring both conditions. Grain-size ratios are preliminary checks, while dispersive soils and gap grading require dedicated testing.||假設基土d85=0.2 mm、反濾D15=0.6 mm，保持比3；另假設反濾k=10⁻⁴ m/s，不能由比值直接推得此k或接受標準。~Assume base d85=0.2 mm and filter D15=0.6 mm, giving retention ratio three. A separate assumed k=10⁻⁴ m/s is not derived from that ratio or an acceptance criterion.||按適用土類檢查完整級配，取施工後樣品確認細料未污染；以缺陷集中滲流試驗核對保持能力和堵塞反應，保留出水顆粒量、時間和水頭差資料。~Check full grading for the relevant soil class and sample placed filters for contamination. Test retention and clogging under concentrated defect flow, preserving particle discharge, time and head-difference records.||施工離析會在局部形成過粗窗口，細料污染則降低排水性。只用料場平均曲線可能同時漏掉這兩種相反缺陷，不能代替鋪設連續性和界面驗證。~Segregation creates locally coarse windows while fines contamination reduces drainage. A stockpile-average curve can miss both opposing defects and cannot replace checks of placement continuity and zone interfaces.||反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。~A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.
排水帶流量與水頭~Drain flow and hydraulic head||排水帶需把滲流導出而不累積高孔壓，其能力取決於滲透率、斷面和水力坡降。出水端堵塞或尾水升高也會改變系統，不能只看材料試驗k值。~A drain must transmit seepage without building high pore pressure. Capacity depends on permeability, area and gradient, while outlet blockage or tailwater changes the system beyond the material permeability value.||假設排水k=0.01 m/s、通流面積2 m²、坡降0.05，Q=kiA=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s；穩定飽和達西流，未含出口損失。~Assume drain k=0.01 m/s, flow area 2 m² and gradient 0.05. Q=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s, for steady saturated Darcy flow without outlet loss.||沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。~Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain. Inspect reduced area from deformation or contamination and use several heads to test the linear Darcy assumption.||高流量時粗料可能出現非達西效應，出口被淹也會降低實際坡降。若把設計名義斷面當永遠有效，會高估經沉降與細料遷移後的排水能力。~Coarse drains can become non-Darcy at high flow, and submerged outlets reduce gradients. Treating nominal section as permanently effective overstates capacity after settlement and fines migration alter the flow paths.||排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。~High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition.
分區方量與邊界污染~Zone volumes and boundary contamination||分區填築的空間邊界維持不同材料的功能，推土機越界和運輸掉料可能造成混雜。總材料量正確不能證明反濾帶厚度或心牆連續性正確。~Zoned placement preserves distinct material functions through spatial boundaries. Equipment crossing and spillage mix materials, so correct total quantities do not establish filter thickness or core continuity.||假設一層心牆長200 m、寬6 m、厚0.25 m，方量300 m³；兩側各混入0.1 m寬帶則受影響10 m³，占3.333%。~Assume core lift length 200 m, width 6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 300 m³. Mixed bands 0.1 m wide on both sides affect 10 m³, or 3.333 percent.||用測量線、照片與批次標記核對每層分區位置，抽查界面粒徑而非只取中間；將跨區車行和材料外溢事件映射到收方面，確認相鄰層邊界連續。~Use survey lines, photographs and batch labels to verify each lift boundary and sample interfaces rather than centers only. Map crossing traffic and spillage to as-built surfaces and check continuity between successive zones.||局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。若只按各料區進場重量驗收，空間錯位會被總量平衡掩蓋。~A small mixed fraction can clog a continuous filter strip, while coarse intrusion damages the core. Acceptance based only on incoming material mass allows spatial misplacement to hide behind a correct total balance.||各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。~Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned.
施工孔壓與載重速率~Construction pore pressure and loading rate||快速加高會讓低滲透心牆來不及排水，新增總應力部分轉為孔壓。施工穩定必須使用相符的排水條件，不能以長期有效應力強度直接取代短期分析。~Rapid raising can load a low-permeability core faster than it drains, converting part of added total stress into pore pressure. Construction stability requires matching drainage conditions rather than substituting long-term behavior.||假設新增總應力100 kPa、量測孔壓增加70 kPa，該增量的有效應力增加30 kPa；以Δσ′=Δσ−Δu計，不等同整體ru。~Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa. Effective stress increases 30 kPa by Δσ′=Δσ−Δu, not a whole-dam ru value.||將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。~Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses. Check pressure-instrument zeros and assess response time using drainage distance and material permeability.||儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。若把總應力增加全部當有效壓密，會高估即時抗剪能力。~Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established. Treating all added total stress as effective compression overstates immediate shear resistance.||新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。~All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress.
快速退水與支承改變~Rapid drawdown and lost support||退水移除上游水體支承，但心牆與坡體孔壓可能來不及下降。外部水位低不代表內部已排水，穩定分析需使用時間相關的孔壓場。~Drawdown removes external upstream support while internal pore pressures can lag. Low reservoir level does not establish drained soil, so stability requires a time-dependent internal pressure field.||假設某點總正應力180 kPa、退水後孔壓仍120 kPa，有效60 kPa；若誤假設孔壓已降40 kPa，會估140 kPa，高估2.333倍。~Assume total normal stress 180 kPa and retained pore pressure 120 kPa, giving effective stress 60 kPa. Assuming pressure already fell to 40 kPa gives 140 kPa, an overestimate by factor 2.333.||比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。~Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces. Reconstruct external support and internal pressure at the same instant and test drainage-rate and strength sensitivity.||把退水後的最低庫位配上早已消散的孔壓會形成不真實荷載組合，忽略外水支承消失又會偏樂觀。慢速表面排水不能代表深部弱層同樣迅速排水。~Combining minimum reservoir level with fully dissipated pressures can create an unrealistic load case, while retaining lost external support is optimistic. Surface drainage does not establish equally rapid drainage in deep weak layers.||水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。~At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum.
''')
 for i,ex,out,un in [(1,'1e-9*5*1000*1000',.005,'L/s'),(2,'(.16-.12)*1000',40,'t'),(3,'.15*2.7/(2.7*1000/1800-1)',.81,'saturation'),(4,'250-50-220',-20,'kPa'),(5,'600*(1-.25)',450,'kPa'),(6,'.6/.2',3,'ratio'),(7,'.01*2*.05*1000',1,'L/s'),(8,'2*.1*200*.25/300*100',3.3333333,'percent'),(9,'100-70',30,'kPa'),(10,'(180-40)/(180-120)',2.3333333,'ratio')]:a('b235',i,ex,out,un)
